  (text "Generated from design.py by generate_board.py - edit design.py, not this file." (at 20.32 330.2 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "89c16b42-52fc-4d49-a971-ddca821e3563"))
  (text "Magnet power switch: holding a magnet on the hull closes the reed switch -> Q3 pulls the P-FET gates low ->" (at 20.32 332.74 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "21256042-2d0e-4455-819a-cafe4d26fcfa"))
  (text "the ESP32 boots and drives PWR_HOLD (GPIO21) high to keep power on. Shutdown = firmware releases PWR_HOLD." (at 20.32 336.55 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "32621e71-3869-47be-8a27-2f4b6e515e7f"))
  (text "All ADC inputs are on ADC1 (GPIO1-10) so they keep working while Wi-Fi talks to the camera." (at 20.32 339.09 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid "804c4762-bac0-4077-9f3d-69bed6c1cbcf"))

